00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:03.070
All right! Kaleido Star is about to start!

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:06.010
While you're watching Kaleido Star,
keep the room brightly lit,

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:08.770
and sit as far from the TV as you can!

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:16.650
Well, well, well.
I've finally bounced back, everyone!

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:20.020
You see, I remembered how fun that day was.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.490
And I remembered my policy:

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:24.090
There's nothing I can't do if I try,

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.360
and if I can do it without trying,
I'll be super lucky!

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.760
And if I'm gonna do it, I just gotta do it!

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:36.470
I'll walk straight through the middle of myself,
and become a real Kaleido Star! I will! I will!

